<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated September 9, 2026. This starter policy describes the launch code included in this package and must be reviewed when you add analytics, ads, accounts, forms or server-side processing.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px"><div class="tool-content"><h2>Browser-local utilities</h2><p>Tools labeled as browser-local perform their calculation or transformation in JavaScript on the visitor's device in this release. The package does not include account registration, a database, advertising tags or analytics tags.</p><h2>Server logs</h2><p>Your hosting provider and web server may create standard access, security and error logs. Their handling depends on your Hostinger configuration and applicable policies.</p><h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p>The theme preference uses browser local storage so a visitor can retain light or dark mode. This starter does not set marketing cookies.</p><h2>Healthcare inputs</h2><p>Healthcare RCM calculators are designed for aggregate values only. Users are instructed not to enter PHI or patient-level identifiers.</p><h2>Changes before production</h2><p>If you add analytics, advertising, contact forms, logins, APIs, payment services or other third-party scripts, update this policy and your consent implementation as required for your users and jurisdictions.</p></div></div></section><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php';?>
